# SKILLS.md

Index of onboarding skills and when to apply them in this repository.

Why this file exists
- Skills are treated as capability artifacts (not ad-hoc prompts).
- Use this index to route to the smallest skill set needed for the session.
- Follow progressive disclosure: read SKILLS first, then open referenced docs only when needed.

Career selection (general-first)
- Always start with the shared baseline:
  - agent_onboarding/agent/general/SKILLS.md
- Ask the user which career to activate next.
- Valid careers: engineer.
- If the user has no preference, use engineer and state that explicitly.
- After selection, read:
  - agent_onboarding/agent/<career>/SKILLS.md (career-specific additions)
- Before explaining the system to the user, follow the required user-doc reading
  rules in agent_onboarding/agent/general/skills/system_orientation.md.

If the user rejects all listed careers, stop and ask for clarification.
